## ── PROJECT IDENTITY ────────────────────────────────────────────
# CrickEyePro is a real-time cricket batting analytics platform.
# It uses YOLOv8 pose estimation + a custom Swin3D shot classifier
# to analyse batting sessions via video. The stack is:
#
#   Frontend  : Vanilla JS (App.js, ReportModal.js, wagonWheel.js)
#               + plain CSS (style.css) + HTML (index.html)
#   Backend   : Node.js/Express (server.js, routes/, services/)
#                  + Python/FastAPI (main.py, analyse_session.py)
#   Database  : Supabase (Postgres + Auth + Storage)
#   ML Models : crickeye_best.pth (Swin3D shot classifier)
#               yolov8n-pose.pt   (YOLOv8 pose estimation)
#   Realtime  : WebSocket (ws://localhost:8000/ws)

