## ── CODE STYLE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
### JavaScript:
# - const/let only — never var
# - async/await — never .then()
# - Arrow functions for callbacks, named functions for top-level
# - Descriptive names: shotData not data, sessionId not id
# - Template literals for HTML string building
# - escapeHtml() for any user-supplied string rendered as innerHTML

### Python:
# - Type hints on new functions
# - f-strings for formatting
# - ws_emit() for all WebSocket messages — never await ws.send_json() directly
# - All file paths via pathlib.Path — never raw string concatenation
# - No bare except: clauses — always catch specific exceptions

